# `hilavitkutin-providers`

Default implementations of the hilavitkutin-api contracts, for a
consumer to register on the scheduler builder with `.with(...)`, one
store at a time or as a Kit. It ships `ArenaColumnStorage`, the arena
`ColumnStorage` over a consumer's `MemoryProvider`; `StaticBumpMemory`,
a memory provider over a buffer the consumer hands it; the interner
(`StringInterner` over an inline `MemoryArena`, and `InternerKit`); the
adapt unit `AdaptWu` with its EMA helpers and the `StandardAdaptKit` and
`OffAdaptKit` presets; and the per-axis metrics resources with
`MetricsKit`. A default clock and an operating-system memory provider
are not in it; the engine's `platform-os` feature carries `OsClock` and
`OsMemoryProvider`. Depends on the api, str and kit crates, never on the
engine.
